                                "sense_id": "ffd9efec-a6e3-328a-8332-245f1eab2024",
                                "text": "MPower Kernow will clear and repair the currently inoperable turntable - allowing steam locomotives to be turned in Cornwall again and opening up the potential for new charter operations."
